1958_973605031391271_5772193790674601249_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DV5qY-6QBEUQ7kNvwHnT5Sj&_nc_oc=AdoRC_jkNuisMGwvdYiRg5kyfg70gLggcr1UuqgWaw4dlOQWS5og0Xdya-MhbYLGLuU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEfdcZ6BF_KU_8_MHIa9BCHSvHD2vMY5lyh8BU0wXcPgQ&oe=6A8C4233"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "New_Project_3.png", "id": "1686683892204452", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391893_1686683895537785_2742684447871003937_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qQ4OO8iO87IQ7kNvwERHW5_&_nc_oc=Adqf8vVfxOiVMDaAS_7UeqCVPCKfZyQ8EGhyT76W7wXf6xVaVimQyoxeZvocBUi0GIg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGtmqjbw6kDkGhZgrEnHx4nozImrzQpFoQcGkA5mn25pg&oe=6A8C3729"}, "display_name": "Monkey Hub VR", "keywords": ["MonkeyHub", "Tag", "Gorilla", "Monkey", "Fangame"], "long_description": "Welcome to Monkey Hub VR!\nMonkey Hub VR is an immersive social hub with tons off fun game modes and maps such as Monke Games a crab game inspired game mode featuring unique Korean children's games or the horror mode were you break into the subliminal side of Monkey Hub VR and fight the mysterious entities.\n\nExperience a world like no other with not just your self but up to 10 players. Monkey Hub VR is a huge world with much to offer and is a place for everyone to let out there inner monkey! \ud83d\udc35 \n\nWith immersive VR gameplay, chaotic fun, and high-stakes challenges, Monkey Hub VR will push your skills to the limit.", "short_description": "Welcome to Monkey Hub VR!\nMonkey Hub VR is an immersive social hub with tons off fun game modes and maps such as Monke Games a crab game inspired game mode featuring unique Korean children's games or the horror mode were you break into the subliminal side of Monkey Hub VR and fight the mysterious entities.\n\nExperience a world like no other with not just your self but up to 10 players. Monkey Hub VR is a h